    "created_at": "2016-10-01T05:15:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-01T05:15:34Z",
    "body": "I am concerned that we are jumping too quickly to this solution. For example, this seems like a bad solution to the issues discussed in #1831. The idea of adding a placeholder object is much better for that.\n\nWe should also not call these threads, as that would be confusing for readers and implementers. We'll need some suitably made-up word.\n",
