    "created_at": "2016-10-05T11:09:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-05T11:09:09Z",
    "body": "Note that this also allows us to remove usage of \"atomically\" (which basically means cannot race with other steps labeled as such). Instead of using that, we'd queue a set of steps to be run in a shared thread. The latter being much more clear as to what is actually intended.\n",
