    "created_at": "2016-10-05T11:16:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-05T11:16:18Z",
    "body": "Yeah, service workers have a lot of these sort of usages. We introduced our own job queue to serialize the jobs that can race, but it was hard to entirely avoid the readers–writers problem. It'd be great if we formalize this kind of generic task-serializing mechanism.\n",
